{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14115","headline":"客堂秋夕 · 戎昱","name":"客堂秋夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隔窗萤影灭复流，北风微雨虚堂秋。\n虫声竟夜引乡泪，蟋蟀何自知人愁。\n四时不得一日乐，以此方悲客游恶。\n寂寂江城无所闻，梧桐叶上偏萧索。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}